        },
        {
          "text": " “Aya ni yo marembo y'umurwa: mu ruhande rw'ikasikazi ni imbingo ibihumbi bine na magana atanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi amarembo y'umurwa azitirirwa amazina y'imiryango ya Isirayeli, mu ruhande rw'ikasikazi amarembo atatu, rimwe ribe irembo rya Rubeni, irindi ribe irembo rya Yuda, irindi ribe irembo rya Lewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mu ruhande rw'iburasirazuba h'imbingo ibihumbi bine na magana atanu habe amarembo atatu, rimwe ribe irembo rya Yosefu, irindi ribe irembo rya Benyamini, irindi ribe irembo rya Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mu ruhande rw'ikusi hagereshejwe imbingo ibihumbi bine na magana atanu habe amarembo atatu, rimwe ribe irembo rya Simiyoni, irindi ribe irembo rya Isakari, irindi ribe irembo rya Zebuluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mu ruhande rw'iburengerazuba h'imbingo ibihumbi bine na magana atanu habe amarembo atatu, rimwe ribe irembo rya Gadi, irindi ribe irembo rya Asheri, irindi ribe irembo rya Nafutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahawukikije hose hazabe imbingo ibihumbi cumi n'umunani, kandi uhereye uwo munsi uwo murwa uzitwa ngo ‘Uwiteka ni ho ari.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
